│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ random_restart_local_search                                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Restructure into three modular stages: (1) a randomized Las Vegas restart loop that runs  │
│                          │ the λ binary-search packing with shuffled model orderings, (2) a best-fit-λ feasibility   │
│                          │ packer shared by all restarts, and (3) a local-search refinement (move/swap off the       │
│                          │ hottest GPU) applied to each candidate. The best final max-KVPR placement across all      │
│                          │ restarts is returned, and all ratios are computed with a guard against zero free memory   │
│                          │ to avoid division-by-zero errors.                                                         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0137                                                                                   │
