│                          │ GPUs, not just the max, which often lets subsequent moves reduce the true maximum. Guard  │
│                          │ with a 3000-iteration cap and use incremental load/mem arrays for speed. This directly    │
│                          │ implements the recommendation to try K=full in the lexicographic top-K objective.         │
